WEBVTT

00:00:01.340 --> 00:00:04.440
The first group in Round 3 
got very heated, didn't it?

00:00:04.840 --> 00:00:07.580
And now, it's time for the 
second group to start.

00:00:07.580 --> 00:00:10.410
Please line up in the order of 
your placement on the paper quiz.

00:00:11.330 --> 00:00:13.240
<i>Mikuriya-kun is in front of me...</i>

00:00:13.710 --> 00:00:16.450
What if I can't answer anything?

00:00:16.450 --> 00:00:19.420
All these other people ranked 
really high on the paper quiz!

00:00:19.420 --> 00:00:20.700
So what?

00:00:21.180 --> 00:00:22.960
There are four in front of me, too.

00:00:25.990 --> 00:00:29.210
<i>He's right. I can't get overwhelmed now.</i>

00:00:29.210 --> 00:00:31.370
<i>I'm finally about to face Mikuriya-kun!</i>

00:00:35.750 --> 00:00:38.490
The second group will now enter.

00:00:43.230 --> 00:00:45.230
Hold it!

00:00:47.740 --> 00:00:49.890
I'm playing, too!

00:02:22.990 --> 00:02:26.450
<b>Question 11: "Q: Why Do You Answer?"</b>

00:02:33.610 --> 00:02:35.960
Akira!

00:02:37.130 --> 00:02:39.050
Huh?!

00:02:42.630 --> 00:02:46.930
U-Um... Sekigawata Middle School 
third-year, Sonohara Akira-kun...

00:02:47.160 --> 00:02:51.320
has, for some reason, just come in
wearing an Asagaoka Girls' uniform!

00:02:52.050 --> 00:02:54.240
He's certainly unique.

00:02:54.240 --> 00:02:57.060
Senpai, you're actually enjoying 
the spectacle, aren't you?

00:02:57.060 --> 00:03:00.040
Wow, he looks really cute.

00:03:00.040 --> 00:03:01.950
This is no time to admire him.

00:03:01.950 --> 00:03:03.200
Look at the participants.

00:03:03.610 --> 00:03:05.550
They're totally distracted from the game.

00:03:05.550 --> 00:03:06.910
This was his plan!

00:03:07.780 --> 00:03:10.120
Excuse me. Can we start the quiz now?

00:03:10.340 --> 00:03:11.740
President Sonohara?

00:03:12.240 --> 00:03:13.710
P-Prepare your boards

00:03:13.710 --> 00:03:15.750
for the multiple answer question 
to determine your initial scores!

00:03:16.140 --> 00:03:16.900
The question!

00:03:16.900 --> 00:03:17.970
Y-Yes, ma'am!

00:03:17.970 --> 00:03:18.840
Too slow!

00:03:18.840 --> 00:03:22.340
<b>My blood is
 boiling right now</b>

00:03:19.520 --> 00:03:22.340
Name the zang-fu organs.

00:03:24.890 --> 00:03:26.290
The zang-fu organs, huh?

00:03:24.890 --> 00:03:28.310
<b>Zang-fu 
Organs</b>

00:03:27.410 --> 00:03:28.310
The full question is...

00:03:28.840 --> 00:03:30.150
In traditional Chinese medicine,

00:03:30.150 --> 00:03:34.830
the body and organs are described 
in terms of the "zang-fu organs."

00:03:34.830 --> 00:03:38.940
State the names of the 
eleven zang-fu organs.

00:03:39.390 --> 00:03:42.330
<i>The number of correct answers I get 
here will be the score I start off with.</i>

00:03:42.330 --> 00:03:44.910
<i>I need to at least get 
close to Mikuriya-kun.</i>

00:03:47.160 --> 00:03:49.780
Even I know a little about this.

00:03:49.780 --> 00:03:54.300
Yes, most people know the names 
of at least some organs.

00:03:54.300 --> 00:03:57.150
But the challenge is knowing 
which ones are zang-fu organs.

00:03:57.540 --> 00:04:00.880
It seems like an easy question that gives 
everyone a chance to get some points,

00:04:01.290 --> 00:04:04.240
but relying on common knowledge 
could backfire on you.

00:04:05.650 --> 00:04:07.930
All players, show your boards!

00:04:07.930 --> 00:04:09.810
<b>Heart
Spleen
Lung
Kidney</b>

00:04:07.930 --> 00:04:09.810
<b>Liver
Stomach
Large Intestine
Gall Bladder</b>

00:04:07.930 --> 00:04:09.810
<b>Urinary Bladder
